# The ready check: a plan with a file that's there, one that's missing and
# one the stage can't show. Prepare says what's wrong on each row and sums
# it up by the name; Run says it under the name.
add fixtures/image.png
add fixtures/missing.mp4
add fixtures/page.html
press ctrl+r
wait 1500
shot 1-prepare
press ctrl+r
wait 500
shot 2-run
